T[1205]={"^Damage taken reduced by (.-)%%%. Duration of root, stun, and incapacitate effects reduced by (.-)%%%.%s*$","El daño recibido se reduce un {{1}}%. La duración de los efectos de inmovilizar, aturdir e incapacitar se reduce un {{2}}%."}
