T[1284]={"^Every |cfffeff9e(.-)|r sec you will leave behind an Infinite Clone that will save your |cfffeff9eHealth|r, |cff01cdfeMana|r and physical location at that time%.\n\nYou can rewind back to your clones with the |cffffffffRewind|r ability%.%s*$","Cada |cfffeff9e{{1}}|r seg dejarás atrás un Clon infinito que salvará tu |cfffeff9eSalud|r, |cff01cdfeManá|r y tu ubicación física en ese momento.\n\nPuedes retroceder hasta tus clones con la habilidad |cffffffffRebobinar|r."}
