T[5509]={"^A seed has been planted inside of you%.\n\nIf the seed is removed by any means, it explodes, inflicting Shadow damage in an area around you and inflicts all targets hit with Corruption%.%s*$","Se ha plantado una semilla dentro de ti.\n\nSi la semilla se elimina por cualquier medio, explota, infligiendo daño de Sombras en un área a tu alrededor e infligiendo Corrupción a todos los objetivos alcanzados."}
T[5510]={"^(.-) Shadow damage inflicted every 3 seconds%.\n\nIf this effect is removed by being dispelled, the remaining damage that would have been inflicted to you is instead dealt directly to the dispeller%.%s*$","{{1}} daño de Sombras infligido cada 3 segundos.\n\nSi este efecto es removido al ser disipado, el daño restante que te habría sido infligido se le causa directamente al dispelador."}
T[5511]={"^Immune to Fear effects%.\nRegenerating (.-)%% health every (.-) seconds%.\nShadow resistance increased by (.-)%.%s*$","Inmune a los efectos de Temor.\nRegenera un {{1}}% de salud cada {{2}} segundos.\nLa resistencia a las Sombras aumenta un {{3}}."}
