T[5913]={"^(.-) Shadow damage inflicted every 1 seconds%.\nHealing received reduced by (.-)%%%.\nRemoved when your health is below 35%%%.%s*$","{{1}} Daño de Sombras infligido cada 1 segundos.\nLa sanación recibida se reduce en {{2}}%.\nSe elimina cuando tu salud es inferior al 35%."}
