T[7092]={"^Dealing damage with |cFFFFFFFFFireball|r or |cFFFFFFFFPyroblast|r grants |cFFFFFFFFLunar Flames|r%.%s*$","Infligir daño con |cFFFFFFFFFuego fatuo|r o |cFFFFFFFFFiroblast|r otorga |cFFFFFFFFFlamas lunares|r."}
