T[9796]={"^Play war drums, causing you to channel for (.-), reducing all Physical Damage taken by (.-)%%%.\n\nWhen the channel ends, gain a unique buff based on the duration of the channel%.\n\n3 seconds %- Damage increased by (.-)%% for (.-)%.\n\n6 seconds %- Critical damage increased by (.-)%% for (.-)%.\n\n9 seconds %- |cffffffffRam|r now triggers a |cffffffffSonic Boom|r%.%s*$","Toca tambores de guerra, causándote que canales durante {{1}} y reduce todo daño Físico recibido en {{2}}%.\n\nCuando termines el canal, obtendrás un beneficio único basado en la duración del canal.\n\n3 segundos - Daño aumentado en {{2}}% durante {{1}}.\n\n6 segundos - Daño crítico aumentado en {{2}}% durante {{1}}.\n\n9 segundos - |cffffffffEmbestir|r ahora activa un |cffffffffBum sónico|r."}
