T[12665]={"^Bleeding for (.-) Physical damage every (.-) sec and Armor is reduced by (.-)%%%.%s*$","Provoca una hemorragia de {{1}} de daño físico cada {{2}} s y reduce la armadura en un {{3}}%."}
