T[13109]={"^Damage done by your Mongoose Bite, Raptor Strike and Counterattack increased by 15%%%.%s*$","El daño de tu Mordedura del Mangosta, Golpe Rápido y Contragolpe aumenta en 15%."}
T[13110]={"^Applies Deadly Poison every 2 seconds%.%s*$","Aplica Veneno Letal cada 2 segundos."}
T[13111]={"^Your next Arcane Shot ricochets to (.-) additional nearby enemies, losing momentum with every target hit%.%s*$","Tu próximo Disparo arcano rebota a {{1}} enemigos cercanos adicionales, perdiendo impulso con cada objetivo alcanzado."}
