T[13295]={"^|cffFF9900Spell Damage|r increased by |cffFF9900(.-)|r and |cffFF9900Attack Power|r increased by |cffFF9900(.-)|r for |cffFF9900(.-)|r%.%s*$","El |cffFF9900poder con hechizos|r aumenta en |cffFF9900{{1}}|r y el |cffFF9900poder de ataque|r aumenta en |cffFF9900{{2}}|r durante |cffFF9900{{3}}|r."}
