T[14031]={"^Causes (.-) plague damage every (.-) sec in a (.-) yard radius for (.-)%.%s*$","Inflige {{1}} de daño de peste cada {{2}} seg en un radio de {{3}} yardas durante {{4}}."}
T[14032]={"^Cause (.-) to (.-) Arcane damage%.%s*$","Provoca que {{1}} cause {{2}} de daño de Arcano."}
