T[17218]={"^Your blade is empowered for (.-)%.\n\nIncreases your critical strike rating by (.-)%% of your Strength%.\n\n%- |cFFFFFFFFDevastate|r: Deals (.-)%% additional damage to nearby enemies and reduces their armor by an additional (.-)%%%. \n\n%- |cFFFFFFFFRiposte|r: Increases your damage staggered, if known, by (.-)%% for (.-)%. \n\n%- |cFFFFFFFFDivine Storm|r: Increases your Armor by (.-)%% of your Strength and your Holy Spell Damage by (.-)%% of your Strength%. Lasts(.-)%.%s*$","Tu hoja se ha potenciado durante {{1}}.\n\nAumenta tu índice de golpe crítico en un {{2}}% de tu fuerza.\n\n- |cFFFFFFFFDevastar|r: Inflige un {{3}}% de daño adicional a los enemigos cercanos y reduce su armadura un {{4}}% adicional. \n\n- |cFFFFFFFFContestación|r: Aumenta tu daño de estancamiento, si se conoce, en un {{5}}% durante {{6}}. \n\n- |cFFFFFFFFTormenta divina|r: Aumenta tu armadura un {{7}}% de tu fuerza y tu daño con hechizos sagrados un {{8}}% de tu fuerza. Dura {{9}}."}
