T[17222]={"^Your blade is empowered for (.-)%.\n\n%- |cFFFFFFFFDevastate|r: Deals (.-)%% additional damage to nearby enemies and reduces their armor by an additional (.-)%%%. \n\n%- |cFFFFFFFFRiposte|r: Increases your damage staggered, if known, by (.-)%% for (.-)%. \n\n%- |cFFFFFFFFDivine Storm|r: Increases your Armor by (.-)%% of your Strength and your Holy Spell Damage by (.-)%% of your Strength%. Lasts(.-)%.%s*$","Tu hoja se ha potenciado durante {{1}}.\n\n- |cFFFFFFFFDevastar|r: Inflige un {{2}}% de daño adicional a los enemigos cercanos y reduce su armadura un {{3}}% adicional. \n\n- |cFFFFFFFFContestación|r: Aumenta tu daño de estancamiento, si se conoce, en un {{4}}% durante {{5}}. \n\n- |cFFFFFFFFTormenta divina|r: Aumenta tu armadura un {{6}}% de tu fuerza y tu daño con hechizos sagrados un {{7}}% de tu fuerza. Dura {{8}}."}
T[17223]={"^Your blade is empowered for (.-)%.\n\n%- |cFFFFFFFFDevastate|r: Deals (.-)%% additional damage to nearby enemies and reduces their armor by an additional (.-)%%%.  \n\n%- |cFFFFFFFFDivine Storm|r: Increases your Armor by (.-)%% of your Strength and your Holy Spell Damage by (.-)%% of your Strength%. Lasts(.-)%.%s*$","Tu hoja se ha potenciado durante {{1}}.\n\n- |cFFFFFFFFDevastar|r: Inflige un {{2}}% de daño adicional a los enemigos cercanos y reduce su armadura un {{3}}% adicional.  \n\n- |cFFFFFFFFTormenta divina|r: Aumenta tu armadura un {{4}}% de tu fuerza y tu daño con hechizos sagrados un {{5}}% de tu fuerza. Dura {{6}}."}
