T[18004]={"^Unmatched speed, entirely intentional!\nHaste and Dodge increased by (.-)%%%.\nMovement speed increased by (.-)%%%.%s*$","¡Una velocidad inigualable, totalmente intencionada!\nLa celeridad y la esquiva aumentan un {{1}}%.\nLa velocidad de movimiento aumenta un {{2}}%."}
