T[18367]={"^Healing power increased by 20%% of Spirit, critical effect chance increased by 6%%%.%s*$","El poder de sanación aumenta un 20% de tu espíritu y la probabilidad de efecto de golpe crítico aumenta un 6%."}
T[18368]={"^Spirit increased by (.-)%%%.\nHealing power increased by (.-)%% of spirit%.%s*$","El espíritu aumenta un {{1}}%.\nEl poder de sanación aumenta un {{2}}% del espíritu."}
