T[20126]={"^Increases the critical strike chance of your Frost spells by (.-)%% and reduces their mana cost by (.-)%.%s*$","Aumenta la probabilidad de golpe crítico de tus hechizos de Escarcha en un {{1}}% y reduce su coste de maná en {{2}}."}
