T[20701]={"^The critical strike chance of the next 2 special abilities is increased by (.-)%% and costs no Focus%.%s*$","La probabilidad de golpe crítico de las próximas 2 habilidades especiales aumenta un {{1}}% y no cuesta Foco."}
